I’m sorry to hear about your experience!

I have looked into your ride and can see that the area you were in is a no-riding zone. These zones are displayed in gray in the app.

A no-riding zone is an area where you're unable to ride or park the vehicle. If you do enter a no-riding zone, the vehicle will reduce its speed and stop which is what happened on your journey.

I recommend checking your route in the app before you ride so you can be aware if your destination is in a no-riding zone and plan accordingly.

If you have any further questions, please let me know.}

