{Operations::Feedback::Recycling
Hi Vojtech,

Thanks for reaching out and for your interest in our recycling efforts.

We recycle all vehicle components that, for safety reasons, can't be repaired or reused. Our local recycling partners (such as Stena Recycling in the Nordics and Paprec in France) separate the batteries and main electronic parts from the body of the vehicle, and recycle them in accordance with local regulations and the highest sustainability standards.

Moreover, we’re currently researching advanced recycling methods for lithium-ion batteries, that have the potential to recycle up to 80% of battery cells.

Learn more about our sustainability efforts on our website, voi.com.

Best,}

